#5000
The Supply Road Below the East Gate~
   The road leaves Midgaard's east gate and runs out across open country,
churned to black mud by wagon wheels and the boots of marching columns. A
wooden board nailed to a post lists the day's convoys in chalk, half of them
crossed out. The fort's walls loom to the west.
