#5001
The Supply Road, Rutted Stretch~
   Ruts as deep as a man's shin score the road, filled with brown water that
never quite dries. Broken spokes and a lost horseshoe lie in the verge.
Fields stretch away on either side, empty of workers this far from the wall.
