The Watch Hill Signal Tower~
   A stone tower stands on the hilltop beside a great iron basket of pitch
and timber, ready to be lit. The wind is constant up here. Far to the west,
beyond Midgaard, the horizon is smudged with a darkness that is not cloud
and never moves.
